You are given an integer N.
Your task is to find the product of all digits of the given number.

Multiply each digit of the number and print the final product.

Input Format

A single integer N

Output Format

Print an integer representing the product of the digits of N


///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

def check(num):
    product = 1

    if num == 0:
        return 0

    while num != 0:
        rem = num % 10
        product *= rem
        num //= 10

    return product

